# Board Agent Toolkit (Cursor)

This repository is a Markdown-first operational state system. Before project work, use the board skills — they are the canonical operating instructions and live in this repo:

- **Board State** — read `skills/board-state/SKILL.md` before starting any project work.
- **Board Edit** — read `skills/board-edit/SKILL.md` before changing any board Markdown.
- **Board New Project** — read `skills/board-new-project/SKILL.md` when asked to add a new project.

Repository entry point: `AGENTS.md` (full operating policy in `docs/INSTRUCTIONS.md`).

## Fast Path

```text
State model:  BOARD.md → projects/<slug>.md → tasks/<slug>-tasks.md
Read down, update up. Files are authoritative — not chat history.
```

## Edits

Never hand-rewrite board Markdown. Use the board CLI:

```text
node ui/lib/cli.js read --board
node ui/lib/cli.js apply <target> '<ops-json>' --dry-run
node ui/lib/cli.js apply <target> '<ops-json>'
node ui/lib/cli.js ops
```

Targets are limited to `BOARD.md`, `projects/*.md`, and `tasks/*-tasks.md`. Ops are validated before writing and writes must re-parse cleanly.

If these skills are not visible to Cursor, install them once:

```powershell
powershell -ExecutionPolicy Bypass -File platform/install-cursor.ps1
```
